From e0f5d7eb91862975a76b669c05332105f5a98932 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Your Name <you@example.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(markdown): ignore outdated preview responses

When Preview is clicked again while an earlier preview request is still
in flight, the earlier response can arrive last and replace the newer
render, so the preview shows text that is no longer in the editor. Render
only the response to the latest request, in the markdown editor and in the
file editor's "Preview" and "Preview Changes" tabs.

